Most filings are several forms, so offer them that way

"There are certain combo filings. Make sure they are available as an
option." Twelve of them: the family adjustment packages, employment,
EB-5, affirmative asylum, removal of conditions, naturalization, the
fiancee petition, both waivers, the green card replacement, and the fee
waiver that rides along with another filing.

Each one names its forms, says who signs each, and says what has to be
TRUE before it is the right package. It does not decide whether it is.
The conditions sit above the form list on the page, because a list of
forms read first is a list assembled first.

Three things this deliberately refuses to do.

It will not multiply a package by the size of a family in a category
that has no derivatives. THE IMMEDIATE RELATIVE CATEGORY HAS NONE: a
citizen's spouse's children do not ride along on the spouse's I-130, they
need petitions of their own. Printing three I-485s for a family of three
would produce a package that cannot be filed, and the person assembling
it has no reason to doubt it. Asked for derivatives there, the page says
in the warning colour that they were not counted, and why.

It will not put the asylum work permit in the envelope with the I-589.
The I-765 cannot be filed until 150 days after a complete application is
received, and one filed early is rejected. It is listed as a later
filing, with the wait and the consequence.

It carries no fee amounts at all. USCIS changes them, uscis-watch.js
already reports a fee notice the day it publishes, and a stale number in
a checklist is worse than no number.

A package hands the G-28 its item 1.b already written, and the form
numbers list only what is actually going in the envelope. Anything typed
on the G-28 page wins over the package, and the package is carried on the
form so pressing "Update this page" does not silently drop it.

22 checks. Every package is checked against uscis-forms.js, so the
edition tracker and the Federal Register watch cover every form in every
package, and a capacity no G-28 box offers fails the build.

